title: Salem5
---
<<declare $playerName = "Holder">>
<<gathervars>>
<<freezePlayer>>
Entering the cafe again, you were met with a different server.

Once again, you were directed to the Art Department.

In the same room, Salem stood, staring at her art intently.

She didn’t notice you enter, only turning when the door shut.

Salem: "Oh! {$playerName}..."
Salem: "Sorry... I was about to leave,"

She seemed distracted, like she was here but also not.

You frowned, worry gnawing at your mind.

-> Ask if she's alright
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump AskIfOkay>>
-> Make conversation
    <<jump MakeConvo>>
-> Ignore It
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump IgnoreIt>>
===

title: AskIfOkay
---
You: "Hey..."
You: "Are you feeling okay?"

Salem looked at you blankly before forcing a small smile.

Salem: "Oh yes, don't worry about me,"

Her tone was dreamy.

You weren't convinced.

<<jump EndSalem5>>
===

title: MakeConvo
---
Despite your concern, you didn’t want to pry into her life.

Maybe light conversation would help instead.

<<jump EndSalem5>>
===

title: IgnoreIt
---
Something felt off about Salem.

She seemed distracted to a fault, like she wasn't all there.

She looked exhausted. It was unsettling.

You ignored it. You weren’t equipped to handle this.

<<jump EndSalem5>>
===

title: EndSalem5
---
Salem: "You're here for the answer, aren't you?"

Her voice was sing-song as she spoke.

You blinked, caught off guard.

You: "Well yes, but—"

She walked to her bag, cutting you off.

She pulled out her notebook and tore out a page.

Returning, she placed the paper into your hands.

She smiled softly, almost dreamlike.

Salem hummed, drawing your attention.

She blinked slowly, her gaze unfocused.

Salem: "That's all... right?"

She yawned, then sighed.

Salem: "My apologies, {$playerName}..."
Salem: "I've been so tired recently..."

You frowned, watching her sway slightly.

You: "You alright? Maybe you should go home early."

A pause.

Salem nodded.

Salem: "Yes..."
Salem: "Yes, I'll do that..."

With one last look, you left.

Even as things seemed fine, something felt very wrong.
<<allowPlayerToMove>>
<<loadScene "CampusGrounds">>
===